              <button onclick="switchScannerCamera()"
                class="mt-3 w-full py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-100 text-xs font-bold">
                <i class="fas fa-camera-rotate mr-2"></i>Ganti Kamera
              </button>
              <p class="mt-2 text-[10px] text-slate-400 text-center">Kamera tetap aktif setelah scan berhasil dan siap
                membaca QR karyawan berikutnya.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card p-6 border border-emerald-100">
              <h3 class="font-bold mb-2"><i class="fas fa-location-dot text-emerald-600 mr-2"></i>Keamanan Lokasi</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-3">Lokasi GPS perangkat dicatat saat absensi. Jika geofence aktif, absensi hanya diterima di area SPBU.</p>
              <div id="scannerLocationStatus" class="text-xs rounded-lg bg-slate-50 p-3 text-slate-600">Lokasi SPBU belum dikonfigurasi.</div>
              <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-2 mt-3">
                <div>
                  <label class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500">Latitude</label>
                  <input id="spbuLatitude" type="number" step="0.000001" min="-90" max="90" class="field mt-1" placeholder="Contoh: -0.123456">
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500">Longitude</label>
                  <input id="spbuLongitude" type="number" step="0.000001" min="-180" max="180" class="field mt-1" placeholder="Contoh: 100.123456">
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500">Radius (meter)</label>
                  <input id="spbuRadius" type="number" min="10" max="1000" step="1" class="field mt-1" value="100">
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-2 mt-3">
                <button type="button" onclick="saveManualSPBULocation()" class="py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 text-white text-xs font-bold"><i class="fas fa-pen mr-2"></i>Simpan Koordinat Manual</button>
                <button type="button" onclick="openSPBUInGoogleMaps()" class="py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 text-white text-xs font-bold"><i class="fas fa-map-location-dot mr-2"></i>Buka Google Maps</button>
                <button type="button" onclick="setCurrentDeviceAsSPBU()" class="py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 text-white text-xs font-bold"><i class="fas fa-location-crosshairs mr-2"></i>Gunakan GPS Saya</button>
                <button type="button" onclick="clearSPBULocation()" class="py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs font-bold"><i class="fas fa-ban mr-2"></i>Nonaktifkan Geofence</button>
              </div>
              <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-2">Admin/Supervisor dapat memasukkan koordinat sendiri. Radius 10–1000 meter. Google Maps dibuka di tab baru.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card p-6">
              <h3 class="font-bold mb-4"><i class="fas fa-id-card text-indigo-500 mr-2"></i>Absen dengan ID Karyawan
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mb-4">Gunakan cara ini bila kamera tidak tersedia.</p>
              <div class="flex gap-2">
                <input id="manualEmployeeId" class="field" placeholder="Contoh: KRY001"
                  onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')submitManualEmployeeId()">
                <button onclick="submitManualEmployeeId()"
                  class="px-4 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 text-white text-xs font-bold">Absen</button>
              </div>
              <div id="scannerLastResult" class="scanner-result mt-5 p-4">
                <div class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold text-slate-400">Hasil Scan Terakhir</div>
                <div id="scannerLastText" class="text-sm font-bold mt-1">Belum ada scan.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card mt-6 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="p-4 border-b flex justify-between items-center">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold">Aktivitas Scan Hari Ini</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Menampilkan catatan absensi terbaru.</p>
              </div>
              <button onclick="renderScannerHistory()"
                class="px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-xs font-bold">Refresh</button>
            </div>
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
              <table class="w-full text-sm">
                <thead class="bg-slate-50 text-[10px] uppercase text-slate-500">
                  <tr>
                    <th class="p-3">No</th>
                    <th class="p-3 text-left">Karyawan</th>
                    <th class="p-3">ID</th>
                    <th class="p-3">Jam Masuk</th>
                    <th class="p-3">Jam Pulang</th>
                    <th class="p-3">Status</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="scannerHistoryTable"></tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- KARTU KARYAWAN -->
        <section id="view-kartu-karyawan" class="view-section">
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between md:items-end gap-3 mb-5">
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold">Kartu Karyawan</h2>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Kartu identitas digital lengkap dengan QR absensi.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <button onclick="printEmployeeCard()"
                class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 text-white text-xs font-bold"><i
                  class="fas fa-print mr-2"></i>Cetak Kartu</button>
              <button onclick="bulkPrintEmployeeCards()"
                class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 text-white text-xs font-bold"><i
                  class="fas fa-layer-group mr-2"></i>Cetak Semua Kartu</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <div class="card p-5">
              <label class="label">Pilih Karyawan</label>
              <select id="cardEmployee" onchange="renderEmployeeCard()" class="field"></select>
              <div class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-500">QR pada kartu dapat digunakan untuk absensi.</div>
              <div class="mt-5 pt-5 border-t">
                <label class="label">Filter Cetak Semua</label>
                <select id="bulkCardShift" class="field" onchange="updateBulkCardInfo()">
                  <option value="">Semua Shift</option>
                </select>
                <div id="bulkCardInfo" class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-2">Semua karyawan akan dicetak.</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="lg:col-span-2">
              <div id="employeeCardPrint" class="employee-card-print max-w-md mx-auto">
                <div class="employee-card-head p-6">
                  <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                    <div>
                      <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-indigo-200">SPBU KOTOBARU CAHAYA UTAMA
                      </div>
                      <div class="font-extrabold mt-1">KARTU KARYAWAN</div>
                      <div class="text-[10px] text-indigo-200 mt-1">No. SPBU 13.262.515</div>
                    </div>
                    <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQ0rKQaMSRhCUyAboOYW80Rgl5AzJirznWTL9zJrK0VAA&amp;s" class="w-10 h-10 object-contain bg-white rounded-lg p-1 employee-card-logo" alt="Pertamina" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src=PERTAMINA_LOGO_DATA_URI;">
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="p-6">
                  <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-5">
                    <div id="cardQr" class="p-2 border rounded-xl bg-white"></div>
                    <div class="text-center sm:text-left">
                      <div id="cardNama" class="text-xl font-extrabold">-</div>
                      <div id="cardId" class="font-mono text-indigo-600 font-bold mt-1">-</div>
                      <div id="cardJabatan" class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2">-</div>
                      <div id="cardShift" class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 mt-1">-</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t text-[10px] text-slate-400 text-center">QR berisi identitas internal
                    karyawan untuk sistem absensi SPBU.</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>
    </main>
  </div>

  <!-- LUPA / GANTI PASSWORD MODAL -->
  <div id="forgotPasswordModal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-[70] modal-backdrop items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl w-full max-w-md shadow-2xl overflow-hidden">
      <div class="p-5 border-b flex justify-between items-center">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-extrabold text-slate-800">Lupa / Ganti Password</h3>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1">Verifikasi akun dengan ID Karyawan dan No. HP terdaftar.</p>
        </div>
        <button type="button" onclick="closeForgotPasswordModal()" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700"
          aria-label="Tutup">
          <i class="fas fa-times"></i>
        </button>
      </div>

      <form onsubmit="resetEmployeePassword(event)" class="p-5 space-y-4">
        <div>
          <label class="label">ID Karyawan</label>
          <input id="forgotEmployeeId" required class="field" placeholder="Contoh: KRY001" autocomplete="username"
            autocapitalize="characters">
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="label">No. HP Terdaftar</label>
          <input id="forgotEmployeeHp" required class="field" placeholder="Contoh: 081234567890" inputmode="tel"
            autocomplete="tel">
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="label">Password Baru</label>
          <div class="relative">
            <input id="forgotNewPassword" type="password" required minlength="6" class="field pr-10"
              placeholder="Minimal 6 karakter" autocomplete="new-password">
            <button type="button" onclick="togglePassword('forgotNewPassword','forgotNewPasswordIcon')"
              class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full px-3 text-slate-400 hover:text-indigo-600"
              aria-label="Tampilkan password baru">
              <i class="fas fa-eye" id="forgotNewPasswordIcon"></i>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="label">Ulangi Password Baru</label>
          <div class="relative">
            <input id="forgotConfirmPassword" type="password" required minlength="6" class="field pr-10"
              placeholder="Ketik ulang password baru" autocomplete="new-password">
            <button type="button" onclick="togglePassword('forgotConfirmPassword','forgotConfirmPasswordIcon')"
              class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full px-3 text-slate-400 hover:text-indigo-600"
              aria-label="Tampilkan konfirmasi password">
              <i class="fas fa-eye" id="forgotConfirmPasswordIcon"></i>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-[11px] text-amber-800">
          <i class="fas fa-shield-alt mr-1"></i>
          Pastikan ID Karyawan dan No. HP yang dimasukkan sesuai data akun Anda.
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-2 justify-end pt-1">
          <button type="button" onclick="closeForgotPasswordModal()"
            class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-sm font-bold">Batal</button>
          <button id="btnResetEmployeePassword"
            class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white text-sm font-bold">
            <i class="fas fa-key mr-1"></i>Ganti Password
          </button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- EMPLOYEE MODAL -->
  <div id="employeeModal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 z-[60] modal-backdrop items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl w-full max-w-2xl shadow-2xl">
      <div class="p-5 border-b flex justify-between items-center">
        <h3 id="employeeModalTitle" class="font-extrabold">Tambah Karyawan</h3>
        <button onclick="closeEmployeeModal()" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-700"><i
            class="fas fa-times"></i></button>
      </div>
      <form onsubmit="saveEmployee(event)" class="p-5 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <input id="empOldId" type="hidden">
        <div><label class="label">ID Karyawan</label><input id="empId" required class="field" placeholder="KRY003">
        </div>
        <div><label class="label">Nama</label><input id="empNama" required class="field" placeholder="Nama lengkap">
        </div>
        <div><label class="label">Jabatan</label><select id="empJabatan" required class="field">
            <option value="">Pilih Jabatan</option>
            <option value="Operator">Operator</option>
            <option value="Kepala Operasional">Kepala Operasional</option>
            <option value="Asisten Kepala Operasional">Asisten Kepala Operasional</option>
            <option value="Supervisor">Supervisor</option>
            <option value="Kepala Keuangan">Kepala Keuangan</option>
          </select></div>
        <div><label class="label">Shift</label><select id="empShift" class="field">
            <option value="">Tanpa Shift</option>
          </select></div>
        <div><label class="label">No. HP</label><input id="empHp" class="field" placeholder="08xxxxxxxxxx"></div>
        <div>
          <label class="label">Password Akun</label>
          <div class="relative">
            <input id="empPassword" class="field pr-16" value="">
            <button type="button" onclick="document.getElementById('empPassword').value = generateEmployeePassword()"
              class="absolute right-8 top-0 h-full px-2 text-slate-400 hover:text-indigo-600"
              title="Buat password baru" aria-label="Buat password baru">
              <i class="fas fa-rotate"></i>
            </button>
            <button type="button" onclick="togglePassword('empPassword','toggleEmpPasswordIcon')"
              class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full px-3 text-slate-400 hover:text-indigo-600"
              aria-label="Tampilkan password akun">
              <i class="fas fa-eye" id="toggleEmpPasswordIcon"></i>
            </button>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 mt-1">Karyawan baru: password otomatis dibuat. Saat edit, kosongkan untuk tetap memakai password lama, atau klik ikon putar untuk membuat yang baru.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-2 flex gap-2 justify-end pt-2">
          <button type="button" onclick="closeEmployeeModal()"
            class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 text-sm font-bold">Batal</button>
          <button class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 text-white text-sm font-bold">Simpan</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>


  <script src="js/config.js"></script>
  <script src="js/storage-cloud.js"></script>
  <script src="js/ui-state.js"></script>
  <script src="js/auth-nav.js"></script>
  <script src="js/dashboard.js"></script>
  <script src="js/employees.js"></script>
  <script src="js/shifts-workdays.js"></script>
  <script src="js/attendance-flow.js"></script>
  <script src="js/monitoring-recap.js"></script>
  <script src="js/scanner.js"></script>
  <script src="js/employee-card-qr.js"></script>
  <script src="js/detailed-recap-status.js"></script>
  <script src="js/utils.js"></script>
  <script src="js/import-employees.js"></script>
  <script src="js/init.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
